{
  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/c7256c608dc041239df6c8badfdfdd52",
  "title": "用户协议、隐私政策生成器居然很赚钱",
  "author": "哥飞",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/c7256c608dc041239df6c8badfdfdd52_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "哥飞小课堂"
  ],
  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/c7256c608dc041239df6c8badfdfdd52_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>用户协议生成器，隐私政策生成器，居然有人投广告，说明能够赚回来。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/c7256c608dc041239df6c8badfdfdd52_img2.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>到底怎么赚呢？</div>\n<div>看我上面截图中红色框中的，只要选择yes，就需要多付24美元或者14美元。</div>\n<div>如果全部都选择yes，一份使用协议，你需要支付138美元。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/c7256c608dc041239df6c8badfdfdd52_img3.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/c7256c608dc041239df6c8badfdfdd52_img4.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>过去12个月时间，这个网站 termify.io 花了29.8万美元广告费。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/c7256c608dc041239df6c8badfdfdd52_img5.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>基本就是围绕着隐私政策、用户协议等相关关键词来投。</div>\n<div>既然他愿意持续不断的花广告费出去，就说明他能够赚回来。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/c7256c608dc041239df6c8badfdfdd52_img6.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>投得更狠的是 iubenda.com ，过去12个月，移动端和PC端总共花了480万美元。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/c7256c608dc041239df6c8badfdfdd52_img7.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.termsofusegenerator.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.termsofusegenerator.net/</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/c7256c608dc041239df6c8badfdfdd52_img8.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.privacypolicygenerator.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.privacypolicygenerator.info/</a></div>\n<div>这两个网站打开就能够发现，就是同一个模板，他们右侧的工具入口，点击之后都会跳转到 <a href=\"https://app.termsfeed.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://app.termsfeed.com/</a> 的相关生成器页面。</div>\n<div>目前还不清楚是为了赚 termsfeed.com 的佣金，还是就是 termsfeed.com 自己用关键词注册了域名来获取流量。</div>\n<div>你看，这里又是我们之前讲过的，用关键词注册域名，举全站之力来优化一个网站的方法。</div>\n<div>用户想找什么，你就得给什么，即使不是你自己做的也行，只要能够帮助用户满足搜索意图。</div>\n<div>这句话很重要，可以帮助大家更快上站。</div>\n<div>解决用户需求，并不一定要自己开发工具。</div>",
